  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F/200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together nimble, kale, bell pepper, onion, cumin seeds, coriander powder, and garlic powder.",
    "Thread the nimble mixture onto the vegan skewers, leaving a 1-inch space between each piece.",
    "Brush the vegan skewers with olive oil and season with salt.",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until the nimble is tender and lightly charred.",
    "Remove the kebabs from the grill and brush with lime juice.",
